<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0.5in">&nbsp;</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0.5in">&ldquo;<B>Property Loan</B>&rdquo;
has the meaning set forth in <B>Section </B>&lrm;<B>4.06(b)</B>.</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0.5in">&nbsp;</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0.5in">&ldquo;<B>Refunding Member</B>&rdquo;
has the meaning set forth in <B>Section </B>&lrm;<B>6.10</B>.</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0.5in">&nbsp;</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0.5in">&ldquo;<B>Replacement Financing</B>&rdquo;
has the meaning set forth in <B>Section 4.02(c)</B>.</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0.5in">&nbsp;</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0.5in">&ldquo;<B>Replacement Financing
Dilution Rate</B>&rdquo; means one percent (1%) for every $200,000,000 (or portion thereof) of Replacement Financing Investment raised
by Platform Co pursuant to <B>Section 4.02(c)</B>.</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0.5in">&nbsp;</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0.5in">&ldquo;<B>Replacement Financing
Investment</B>&rdquo; means the aggregate cash proceeds received by the Company or any Subsidiary from third-party investors pursuant
to Platform Co&rsquo;s exercise of its Replacement Financing right under <B>Section 4.02(c)</B>.</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0.5in">&nbsp;</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0.5in">&ldquo;<B>Regulatory Allocations</B>&rdquo;
has the meaning set forth in <B>Section </B>&lrm;<B>6.02(h)</B>.</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0.5in">&nbsp;</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0.5in">&ldquo;<B>Removal Date</B>&rdquo;
has the meaning set forth in <B>Section&nbsp;&lrm;7.01(g)</B>.</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0.5in">&nbsp;</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0.5in">&ldquo;<B>Reserve Accounts</B>&rdquo;
means such cash reserves of the Company and/or any Subsidiary as are set forth in the Operating Budget for the payment of expenditures.</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0.5in">&nbsp;</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0.5in">&ldquo;<B>Revenues</B>&rdquo;
means, for any period, the sum of the total gross operating cash received by the Company during such period, including, without duplication,
all receipts of the Company from (a)&nbsp;rent, lease payments, and service fees (including additional rent and percentage rent) paid
to the Company or any Subsidiary under any tenant lease, colocation agreement, or interconnection agreement, (b)&nbsp;revenue from Cue
activities, (c)&nbsp;expense reimbursements, (d)&nbsp;proceeds from business interruption or other insurance, if any, (e)&nbsp;funds that
are withdrawn from the Company&rsquo;s Reserve Accounts and deposited into the Subsidiary&rsquo;s operating accounts, and (f)&nbsp;other
amounts received by the Company or Subsidiary in connection with the operation of its business (other than unapplied Capital Contributions);
<I>provided, however</I>, that Revenues shall not include (x)&nbsp;Capital Event Proceeds, and (y)&nbsp;any amounts received by the Company
incident to the liquidation of the Company.</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0.5in">&nbsp;</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0.5in">&ldquo;<B>Revised Partnership
